{"id":"n32565-1-8","stage":4,"title":"깨소금 · 芝麻盐","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32565-1-8-1","ko":"어디서 이렇게 고소한 냄새가 나는 거야?","zh":"这是哪儿飘来这么香的味道啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"고소한","meaning":"香，香喷喷","explanation":"고소하다：香，香喷喷；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"고소하다","audio":"/audio/4f40403c6a05970822b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17967","senseId":"1","lemma":"고소하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고소한","audio":"/audio/99a66947747773e40201.mp3"}},{"text":"냄새가","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냄새가","audio":"/audio/355d1601ad77a55c071d.mp3"}},{"text":"나는","meaning":"发出、散发（냄새가 나다：散发气味）","explanation":"나다：发出、散发（냄새가 나다：散发气味）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"4f40403c6a059708","term":"고소하다","zh":"香，香喷喷","audio":"/audio/4f40403c6a05970822b7.mp3","entryId":"17967","definition":"有和炒芝麻或现烤面包的气味或味道一样的感觉。","pronunciation":["고소하다"]},{"id":"a67d0d1b921d4bc4","term":"냄새","zh":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3","entryId":"58180","definition":"能用鼻子闻到的味儿。","pronunciation":["냄ː새"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出、散发（냄새가 나다：散发气味）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"发出、散发（냄새가 나다：散发气味）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/94155eecdee9a773be0e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32565-1-8-2","ko":"어머니께서 깨소금을 볶고 계셔.","zh":"妈妈正在炒芝麻盐呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니께서","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니께서","audio":"/audio/dc043d4fbae2ed5d909f.mp3"}},{"text":"깨소금을","meaning":"芝麻盐","explanation":"깨소금：芝麻盐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"깨소금","audio":"/audio/f2a378291fce169d6651.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32565","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨소금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨소금을","audio":"/audio/d887239afa1b5c2584a3.mp3"}},{"text":"볶고","meaning":"炒","explanation":"볶다：炒；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"볶다","audio":"/audio/bb290b67b533b283b839.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59753","senseId":"1","lemma":"볶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볶고","audio":"/audio/a60131122c6961499e65.mp3"}},{"text":"계셔.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）","explanation":"계시다：正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61346","senseId":"1","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계셔","audio":"/audio/c0e9775be6405aee1073.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"f2a378291fce169d","term":"깨소금","zh":"芝麻盐","audio":"/audio/f2a378291fce169d6651.mp3","entryId":"32565","definition":"炒制后碾碎的芝麻；或指在芝麻粉中加盐制成的一种带有香味的作料。","pronunciation":["깨소금"]},{"id":"bb290b67b533b283","term":"볶다","zh":"炒","audio":"/audio/bb290b67b533b283b839.mp3","entryId":"59753","definition":"把几乎没有水分的东西放在火上一边搅拌一边弄熟。","pronunciation":["복따"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"61346","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e967ceb506aafd628ea6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.87,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32565","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这是哪儿飘来这么香的味道啊？","妈妈正在炒芝麻盐呢。","只要明天赢了这场比赛，我们就进半决赛了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是哪儿飘来这么香的味道啊